{
  "type": "html",
  "title": "连续分配存储管理方式可视化",
  "html_content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>连续分配存储管理</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 20px;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n        }\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        header {\\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2c3e50, #3498db);\\n            color: white;\\n            padding: 20px;\\n            text-align: center;\\n        }\n        h1 {\n            margin: 0;\n            font-size: 2em;\n        }\n        .subtitle {\n            opacity: 0.9;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n        }\n        .main-content {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n        .controls {\n            width: 30%;\n            padding: 15px;\n            border-right: 1px solid #eee;\n        }\n        .canvas-area {\n            flex: 1;\n            min-width: 600px;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        canvas {\n            display: block;\n            background: #f8f9fa;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n        }\n        .legend {\\n            margin-top: 15px;\\n            padding: 10px;\\n            background: #ecf0f1;\\n            border-radius: 6px;\\n            font-size: 0.9em;\\n        }\n        button {\n            background: #3498db;\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            padding: 8px 16px;\n            margin: 5px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n        }\n        button:hover {\n            background: #2980b9;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n        }\n        .mode-selector {\n            margin: 15px 0;\n        }\n        select {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 8px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        }\n        .info-panel {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            padding: 15px;\n            background: #fff8e1;\n            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 900px) {\n            .main-content {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n            .controls {\n                border-right: none;\n                border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <h1>🧠 连续分配存储管理方式</h1>\n            <p class=\"subtitle\">可视化展示单一连续、固定分区与动态分区分配机制</p>\n        </header>\n        <div class=\"main-content\">\n            <div class=\"controls\">\n                <div class=\"mode-selector\">\n                    <label for=\"allocType\">分配类型：</label><br>\n                    <select id=\"allocType\" onchange=\"switchMode()\">\n                        <option value=\"single\">单一连续分配</option>\n                        <option value=\"fixed\">固定分区分配</option>\n                        <option value=\"dynamic\">动态分区分配</option>\n                    </select>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"dynamicControls\" style=\"display:none;\">\n                    <label for=\"algoSelect\">算法选择：</label><br>\n                    <select id=\"algoSelect\" onchange=\"updateAlgorithm()\">\n                        <option value=\"firstfit\">首次适应 (FF)</option>\n                        <option value=\"bestfit\">最佳适应 (BF)</option>\n                        <option value=\"worstfit\">最坏适应 (WF)</option>\n                    </select>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <button onclick=\"allocateMemory()\">▶️ 分配内存</button>\n                    <button onclick=\"freeMemory()\">⬅️ 释放内存</button>\n                    <button onclick=\"resetMemory()\">🔄 重置</button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"info-panel\">\n                    <strong>💡 提示：</strong>\n                    • 鼠标悬停在内存块上查看详细信息\n                    • 尝试不同算法观察差异\n                    • 拖动滑块调整初始内存大小\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"canvas-area\">\n                <canvas id=\"memoryCanvas\" width=\"700\" height=\"400\"></canvas>\n                <div class=\"legend\">\n                    <span style=\"color:#666;\">■ 空闲区 | ■ 已分配区 | ↕ 进程边界</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('memoryCanvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let memoryBlocks = [];\n        let currentAllocation = null;\n        let mouseX = -1, mouseY = -1;\n        \n        // 初始化内存状态\n        function initMemory() {\n            memoryBlocks = [{\n                start: 0,\n                size: 600,\n                allocated: false,\n                pid: null\n            }];\n            drawMemory();\n        }\n        \n        // 绘制内存视图\n        function drawMemory() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n            \n            // 绘制背景网格\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#e0e0e0';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n            for(let i = 0; i < canvas.width; i += 20) {\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(i, 0);\n                ctx.lineTo(i, canvas.height);\n                ctx.stroke();\n            }\n            for(let j = 0; j < canvas.height; j += 20) {\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(0, j);\n                ctx.lineTo(canvas.width, j);\n                ctx.stroke();\n            }\n            \n            // 绘制内存块\n            memoryBlocks.forEach((block, index) => {\\n                const x = Math.round(block.start / 10);\\n                const width = Math.round(block.size / 10);\\n                \\n                if(width <= 0) return;\\n                \\n                ctx.fillStyle = block.allocated ? \\n                    'rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.7)' : \\n                    'rgba(149, 165, 166, 0.5)';\\n                ctx.fillRect(x, 50, width, canvas.height - 100);\\n                \\n                // 边框\\n                ctx.strokeStyle = block.allocated ? '#2980b9' : '#7f8c8d';\\n                ctx.lineWidth = 2;\\n                ctx.strokeRect(x, 50, width, canvas.height - 100);\\n                \\n                // 标签\\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#2c3e50';\\n                ctx.font = 'bold 12px Arial';\\n                ctx.textAlign = 'center';\\n                ctx.fillText(\\n                    `[${index}]`,\n                    x + width/2,\n                    35\n                );\n                \n                // 尺寸信息\n                ctx.font = '11px Arial';\n                ctx.fillText(\n                    `Size: ${Math.round(block.size)}KB`,\n                    x + width/2,\n                    canvas.height - 20\n                );\n                \n                // 进程ID\n                if(block.allocated && block.pid !== null) {\n                    ctx.fillStyle = '#e74c3c';\n                    ctx.font = 'italic 14px Arial';\n                    ctx.fillText(\n                        `PID: ${block.pid}`,\n                        x + width/2,\n                        70\n                    );\n                }\n            });\n            \n            // 高亮鼠标位置的块\n            if(mouseX >= 0 && mouseY >= 0) {\n                memoryBlocks.forEach((block, index) => {\\n                    const x = Math.round(block.start / 10);\\n                    const width = Math.round(block.size / 10);\\n                    if(mouseX >= x && mouseX <= x + width && mouseY >= 50 && mouseY <= canvas.height - 50) {\\n                        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.3)';\\n                        ctx.fillRect(x, 50, width, canvas.height - 100);\\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 分配内存函数\n        function allocateMemory() {\n            const algo = document.getElementById('algoSelect').value;\n            const size = parseInt(prompt('请输入请求的内存大小(KB):')) || 100;\n            \n            if(size <= 0) {\n                alert('无效的大小！');\n                return;\n            }\n            \n            switch(algo) {\n                case 'firstfit':\n                    firstFitAllocation(size);\n                    break;\n                case 'bestfit':\n                    bestFitAllocation(size);\n                    break;\n                case 'worstfit':\n                    worstFitAllocation(size);\n                    break;\n            }\n            drawMemory();\n        }\n        \n        // 首次适应算法\n        function firstFitAllocation(size) {\n            for(let i = 0; i < memoryBlocks.length; i++) {\n                if(!memoryBlocks[i].allocated && memoryBlocks[i].size >= size) {\n                    memoryBlocks[i].allocated = true;\n                    memoryBlocks[i].pid = generatePID();\n                    console.log(`First Fit: Allocated ${size}KB to PID ${memoryBlocks[i].pid}`);\n                    return;\n                }\n            }\n            alert('没有足够的空闲空间！');\n        }\n        \n        // 最佳适应算法\n        function bestFitAllocation(size) {\n            let bestIndex = -1;\n            let minDiff = Infinity;\n            \n            for(let i = 0; i < memoryBlocks.length; i++) {\n                if(!memoryBlocks[i].allocated && memoryBlocks[i].size >= size) {\n                    const diff = Math.abs(memoryBlocks[i].size - size);\n                    if(diff < minDiff) {\n                        minDiff = diff;\n                        bestIndex = i;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            \n            if(bestIndex !== -1) {\n                memoryBlocks[bestIndex].allocated = true;\n                memoryBlocks[bestIndex].pid = generatePID();\n                console.log(`Best Fit: Allocated ${size}KB to PID ${memoryBlocks[bestIndex].pid}`);\n            } else {\n                alert('没有足够的空闲空间！');\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 最坏适应算法\n        function worstFitAllocation(size) {\n            let worstIndex = -1;\n            let maxSize = -1;\n            \n            for(let i = 0; i < memoryBlocks.length; i++) {\n                if(!memoryBlocks[i].allocated && memoryBlocks[i].size >= size) {\n                    if(memoryBlocks[i].size > maxSize) {\n                        maxSize = memoryBlocks[i].size;\n                        worstIndex = i;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            \n            if(worstIndex !== -1) {\n                memoryBlocks[worstIndex].allocated = true;\n                memoryBlocks[worstIndex].pid = generatePID();\n                console.log(`Worst Fit: Allocated ${size}KB to PID ${memoryBlocks[worstIndex].pid}`);\n            } else {\n                alert('没有足够的空闲空间！');\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 释放内存\n        function freeMemory() {\n            if(currentAllocation !== null) {\n                memoryBlocks[currentAllocation].allocated = false;\n                memoryBlocks[currentAllocation].pid = null;\n                currentAllocation = null;\n                console.log('Memory freed');\n                drawMemory();\n            } else {\n                alert('没有可释放的内存块！');\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // 重置内存\n        function resetMemory() {\n            initMemory();\n        }\n        \n        // 切换模式\n        function switchMode() {\n            const mode = document.getElementById('allocType').value;\n            const dynamicCtrl = document.getElementById('dynamicControls');\n            dynamicCtrl.style.display = mode === 'dynamic' ? 'block' : 'none';\n        }\n        \n        // 更新算法\n        function updateAlgorithm() {\n            // 可以根据需要扩展此函数\n        }\n        \n        // 生成随机PID\n        function generatePID() {\n            return Math.floor(Math.random() * 1000);\n        }\n        \n        // 事件监听\n        canvas.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n            mouseX = e.clientX - rect.left;\n            mouseY = e.clientY - rect.top;\n            drawMemory();\n        });\n        \n        canvas.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n            mouseX = -1;\n            mouseY = -1;\n            drawMemory();\n        });\n        \n        // 初始化\n        initMemory();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "description": "本动画通过Canvas可视化展示了三种连续分配存储管理方式：1)单一连续分配——仅保留一道程序占用全部内存；2)固定分区分配——预先划分多个固定大小的分区供多道程序共享；3)动态分区分配——根据实际需求动态划分内存块，并演示了首次适应(FF)、最佳适应(BF)、最坏适应(WF)三种典型算法的差异。用户可通过下拉菜单切换分配类型，选择不同算法进行内存分配/释放操作，直观感受各算法对内存利用率的影响。",
  "subtype": "animation"
}